{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategize</strong><br>Inspired by <i>TFT</i>'s item and augment system, this game gives you endless ways to customize your strategy. With a dash of <i>Vampire Survivors</i> chaos, you'll need quick thinking and even quicker reflexes to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/extras/f1c17a733b5cd6846391f7b768023900.avif?t=1752086241\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget just placing towers, You can build walls to control the enemy's path, turning the battlefield into your personal puzzle. Get creative and manipulate your enemies in clever ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend</strong><br>You\u2019re on crystal duty! Protect the chained, corrupted crystal while you work to complete a ritual that will set it free. The stakes are high\u2014don\u2019t let the enemies break through!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catch \u2018Em All</strong><br>Once the ritual is complete and the crystal is released, it joins your collection. Each crystal brings new powers and upgrades, helping you take on even bigger challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless combinations</strong><br>With so many ways to play and strategize, each run is different from the last. The more crystals you collect, the stronger you get, but be ready\u2014tougher enemies are always on the way!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734940?t=1752086241","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/857e9740f3ae2c8468735f069f2ef4f780b2e52c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752086241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/ee54c923970b2a3