rs and upgrades, helping you take on even bigger challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless combinations</strong><br>With so many ways to play and strategize, each run is different from the last. The more crystals you collect, the stronger you get, but be ready\u2014tougher enemies are always on the way!</p></li></ul>","developers":["EpLap Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734940/11e049a395fd2348655122be518bd4fb743aae8f/header.jpg?t=1752086241","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140895,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140895/movie480.mp4?t=1752086239","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140895/movie_max.mp4?t=1752086239"},"name":"Hexbloom Showcase placeholder","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140895/cc86a11f203c7e056155d625b09d2973e856ca7c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752086239","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140895/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752086239","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140895/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752086239"}}],"name":"Hextalia","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz 4-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><stron